Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Q)Show that image of right half plane Re z = x > 1under linear transformation \
w = (-1 + i)z -2 +3i is the half plane v> u+ 7 where u is Re w and v is Im w. \
Plot the map.\
\>", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->CompressedData["
1:eJxTTMoPSmViYGCQBGIQzfOJ49jZdW8d5+p8uQKi3x3n/Aei3+r6gelFp7al
